WEBVTT

00:00:09.352 --> 00:00:10.592
(TOYS COUGHING)

00:00:13.192 --> 00:00:14.672
You got all your pieces?

00:00:14.752 --> 00:00:16.352
The claw!

00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:19.952
MRS. POTATO HEAD: My babies!
WOODY: Hey, guys! No! No!

00:00:21.352 --> 00:00:22.952
-No!
-(MRS. POTATO HEAD SCREAMS)

00:00:24.272 --> 00:00:25.352
(SCREAMING)

00:00:29.032 --> 00:00:30.272
WOODY: Hang on!

00:00:39.712 --> 00:00:40.872
(TOYS GROANING)

00:00:40.952 --> 00:00:42.032
(COUGHING)

00:00:43.472 --> 00:00:44.792
Woody! What do we do?

00:00:44.872 --> 00:00:46.632
We'll be okay if we stay togeth...

00:00:47.872 --> 00:00:49.552
-Woody!
-Slinky!

00:00:51.072 --> 00:00:53.072
It's a magnet! Watch out!

00:00:53.632 --> 00:00:55.992
WOODY: Don't worry, Slink,
we'll get you down.

00:00:56.072 --> 00:00:57.712
You might wanna take a look at this.

00:01:01.752 --> 00:01:03.312
Quick! Grab something metal!

00:01:08.552 --> 00:01:09.992
You heard the guy.

00:01:13.912 --> 00:01:15.672
It's not working!

00:01:19.352 --> 00:01:22.512
Help! Help me. I'm stuck!

00:01:22.872 --> 00:01:25.392
Help, please! Help!

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.272
Woody!

00:01:29.752 --> 00:01:31.432
-Thank you.
-Don't thank me yet.

00:01:34.392 --> 00:01:35.512
Woody!

00:01:45.192 --> 00:01:46.272
Go, go!

00:01:52.272 --> 00:01:53.712
Thank you, Sheriff.

00:01:53.792 --> 00:01:54.952
We're all in this together.

00:01:55.272 --> 00:01:56.392
Right, guys?

00:01:57.872 --> 00:01:58.912
Guys?

00:01:59.192 --> 00:02:01.392
JESSIE: Woody! Down here!

00:02:04.032 --> 00:02:06.032
-Woody!
-HAMM: Oh, boy.

00:02:08.072 --> 00:02:10.392
Woody, look. I can see daylight.

00:02:10.472 --> 00:02:12.232
We're gonna be okay!

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:14.152
HAMM: Hey!

00:02:14.792 --> 00:02:16.472
I don't think that's daylight.

00:02:22.712 --> 00:02:23.952
Run!

00:02:32.472 --> 00:02:33.512
(GASPS)

00:02:40.592 --> 00:02:44.232
Sheriff! The button! Help me!

00:02:44.352 --> 00:02:45.352
Come on!

00:02:47.112 --> 00:02:49.192
Go. Go! Hit the button!

00:02:53.672 --> 00:02:54.672
(GASPING)

00:02:56.752 --> 00:02:57.832
Hurry!

00:03:01.152 --> 00:03:03.672
WOODY: Just push it! Push it!
BUZZ: Push it!

00:03:04.792 --> 00:03:07.152
Where's your kid now, Sheriff?

00:03:07.672 --> 00:03:08.832
No. No!

00:03:09.032 --> 00:03:10.032
Lotso!

00:03:12.352 --> 00:03:13.512
No!

00:03:23.472 --> 00:03:25.392
(ALL GRUNTING)

00:03:29.552 --> 00:03:30.632
(REX EXCLAIMING)

00:03:30.712 --> 00:03:31.792
Rex!

00:03:37.712 --> 00:03:39.872
Buzz! What do we do?

00:05:00.312 --> 00:05:02.112
The claw.

00:05:23.992 --> 00:05:26.312
(TOYS GROANING)

00:05:27.512 --> 00:05:28.592
(SIGHS IN RELIEF)

00:05:29.992 --> 00:05:32.912
You know all that bad stuff I said
about Andy's attic?

00:05:32.992 --> 00:05:34.272
I take it all back.

00:05:34.512 --> 00:05:36.312
-You're darn tootin'.
-You said it.

00:05:42.672 --> 00:05:45.512
Oh, darling. You were so brave.

00:05:47.032 --> 00:05:50.352
-You saved our lives.
-And we are eternally grateful.

00:05:51.672 --> 00:05:53.032
My boys!

00:05:53.152 --> 00:05:54.352
Daddy!

00:05:54.792 --> 00:05:56.872
Hey! Where's that fur ball Lotso?

00:05:56.992 --> 00:05:58.992
Yeah. I'd like to loosen his stitchin'.

00:05:59.272 --> 00:06:01.832
Forget it, guys. He's not worth it.

00:06:05.552 --> 00:06:06.792
(TRUCK APPROACHING)

00:06:06.872 --> 00:06:08.272
(GASPS)

00:06:11.192 --> 00:06:12.712
MAN 1: Hey!
MAN 2: What you got?

00:06:12.792 --> 00:06:15.312
I had me one of these when I was a kid.

00:06:15.392 --> 00:06:16.472
(SNIFFING)

00:06:16.552 --> 00:06:17.872
Strawberries.

00:06:19.952 --> 00:06:21.312
(WHIMPERING)

00:06:21.712 --> 00:06:24.552
Hey, buddy. You might wanna
keep your mouth shut.

00:06:24.672 --> 00:06:25.832
(LAUGHING)

00:06:31.072 --> 00:06:33.472
JESSIE: Come on, Woody.
We gotta get you home.

00:06:33.552 --> 00:06:36.032
-That's right, college boy.
-Wait.

00:06:36.912 --> 00:06:38.152
What about you guys? I mean,

00:06:39.392 --> 00:06:41.832
maybe the attic's not such a great idea.

00:06:42.232 --> 00:06:46.872
-We're Andy's toys, Woody.
-We'll be there for him, together.

00:06:48.672 --> 00:06:50.912
-I just hope he hasn't left yet.
-MRS. POTATO HEAD: Wait a minute!

00:06:51.032 --> 00:06:52.752
Wait, I'll check!

00:06:52.832 --> 00:06:54.672
Andy's still packing.

00:06:54.752 --> 00:06:56.752
(GASPS) But he's almost done!

00:06:56.872 --> 00:07:00.672
-He lives halfway across town.
-We'll never get there in time!

00:07:00.752 --> 00:07:03.192
(HUMMING GUITAR RIFFS)

